===== Easy way to install OpenWrt using Windows and Tiny PXE Server =====

On this video https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=48mcR4oGn_0 , you will see how to use Tiny PXE Server on Windows to easily install Open WRT. Although it applies to a different device, the steps are exactly the same for the most Mikrotik Devices.



==== Flash Layout ====
<code>
root@OpenWrt:~# cat /proc/mtd
dev:    size   erasesize  name
mtd0: 00020000 00010000 "RouterBoot"
mtd1: 0000e000 00010000 "bootloader1"
mtd2: 00001000 00010000 "hard_config"
mtd3: 00001000 00010000 "bios"
mtd4: 0000f000 00010000 "bootloader2"
mtd5: 00001000 00010000 "soft_config"
mtd6: 00fe0000 00010000 "firmware"
</code>

